size limits.\n\tr=jschanck,mt,bbeurdouche,rrelyea\n\n\t[dea71cbef9e0] \u003cNSS_3_68_1_BRANCH\u003e\n\n2021-07-08  Benjamin Beurdouche  \u003cbbeurdouche@mozilla.com\u003e\n\n\t* .hgtags:\n\tAdded tag NSS_3_68_RTM for changeset 3680dc580194\n\t[da3d22d708c9] \u003cNSS_3_68_BRANCH\u003e\n```\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D132576", "files": ["security/nss/TAG-INFO", "security/nss/coreconf/coreconf.dep", "security/nss/gtests/certdb_gtest/decode_certs_unittest.cc", "security/nss/lib/cryptohi/secvfy.c", "security/nss/lib/nss/nss.h", "security/nss/lib/pkcs7/certread.c", "security/nss/lib/softoken/softkver.h", "security/nss/lib/util/nssutil.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "b6173cd78c9d522f2e3257c408933db4f9cedc13", "parents": ["ef95c549be70797e93734c51d5fbb4f662ec69ff"], "tags": []}], "date": 1638378313, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "115": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Update configs. IGNORE BROKEN CHANGESETS CLOSED TREE NO BUG a=release ba=release", "files": ["browser/config/version.txt", "browser/config/version_display.txt", "config/milestone.txt"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2ca51204aeb2e5c373c5b648fddfca4afc84180e", "parents": ["b6173cd78c9d522f2e3257c408933db4f9cedc13"], "tags": []}], "date": 1638817875, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld-merge"}, "116": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr91 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings tld-suffixes - a=repo-update r=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D132928", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "6764bd4047c392e71018f8ee85394c1cf8564304", "parents": ["2ca51204aeb2e5c373c5b648fddfca4afc84180e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1638826224, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "117": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 3359a85a2277bbcbcc2b5ebcc425922a23d07f34 with FIREFOX_91_4_0esr_RELEASE a=release CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "6da34d9a94524fb2385e335209fd27fba84f6660", "parents": ["6764bd4047c392e71018f8ee85394c1cf8564304"], "tags": []}], "date": 1638885332, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "118": {"changesets": [{"author": "Robert Mader \u003crobert.mader@posteo.de\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1731428 - Do not advertise DmaBuf support for Pipewire screen sharing, r=stransky a=RyanVM\n\nRight now we only support simple mem-copy from a given DmaBuf instead\nof using the driver to get the data. This can fail in many ways, e.g.\nif buffer modifiers are used.\nUntil we support proper handling of DmaBuf, stop advertising it to\nPipewire.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D126824", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/webrtc/modules/desktop_capture/linux/base_capturer_pipewire.cc"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "668b81ab07827519b2cdb5efa25af0ab58370e3c", "parents": ["6da34d9a94524fb2385e335209fd27fba84f6660"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Robert Mader \u003crobert.mader@posteo.de\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1618914 - Fall back to ftruncate if posix_fallocate isn't supported by filesystem, r=stransky a=RyanVM\n\nRebase of a patch by Jan Beich \u003cjbeich@FreeBSD.org\u003e\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D132482", "files": ["widget/gtk/WaylandShmBuffer.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "cffffaa8d2eabe7c46f6aa5d2723e47f1a105f34", "parents": ["668b81ab07827519b2cdb5efa25af0ab58370e3c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Steve Fink \u003csfink@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1743515 - Add dynamic check for valid serialized length. r=jonco, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D132420", "files": ["js/src/jsapi-tests/testStructuredClone.cpp", "js/src/vm/StructuredClone.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "8f37f03f9856bd5a707a4a118616fd009511fa33", "parents": ["cffffaa8d2eabe7c46f6aa5d2723e47f1a105f34"], "tags": []}], "date": 1638992350, "git_changesets": [null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "119": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr91 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings tld-suffixes - a=repo-update r=RyanVM,dsmith\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D133341", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "ce75f11a59b35a2621e82644fcbb5a280040de6a", "parents": ["8f37f03f9856bd5a707a4a118616fd009511fa33"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1732577 - Fix interpretation of Fontconfig hinting toggle in PrepareFontOptions. r=jfkthame, a=RyanVM\n\nIn bug 1547063, a bug was introduced where a logic condition was improperly negated.\n!(printing || !hinting) became (!printing || hinting), when the negation is actually\n!printing && hinting. This fixes that so that we do the right thing here and actually\nignore the following hint-style check if hinting is false.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D128017", "files": ["gfx/thebes/gfxFcPlatformFontList.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "f4f25ebd5e48b1e38e12643dd5b3cb8cbe39d56e", "parents": ["ce75f11a59b35a2621e82644fcbb5a280040de6a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1732577 - Don't round FT glyph extents when hinting is disabled. r=jfkthame, a=RyanVM\n\nThis bug originated from bug 1547063 when we started to allow subpixel positioning\nfor FreeType fonts. It would check if we requested no hinting from FreeType and\nalways try to round the X extents. However, light hinting disables X hinting as\nwell (just not Y hinting), so the behavior in this case diverged between light and\nno hinting. This should make the two cases now look similar.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D131537", "files": ["gfx/thebes/gfxFT2FontBase.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1d55ecb28ee77145d7c640cae3ea7701c7da0981", "parents": ["f4f25ebd5e48b1e38e12643dd5b3cb8cbe39d56e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gijs Kruitbosch \u003cgijskruitbosch@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1742694, r=mconley,mt a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D132259", "files": ["toolkit/modules/Troubleshoot.jsm"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "f0d2e2d098d54e413ea2a6e7b4d04cb069b81830", "parents": ["1d55ecb28ee77145d7c640cae3ea7701c7da0981"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1642583 - Push clips when applying D2D blend effect. r=jrmuizel, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D132723", "files": ["gfx/2d/DrawTargetD2D1.cpp", "layout/reftests/bugs/1642583-1-ref.html", "layout/reftests/bugs/1642583-1.html", "layout/reftests/bugs/reftest.list"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "42d495bb5940d7c18b6b4b09484b8493ee223cf7", "parents": ["f0d2e2d098d54e413ea2a6e7b4d04cb069b81830"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1336591 - Push clips when applying D2D gradients. r=aosmond, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D132865", "files": ["gfx/2d/DrawTargetD2D1.cpp", "layout/reftests/bugs/1336591-1-ref.html", "layout/reftests/bugs/1336591-1.html", "layout/reftests/bugs/reftest.list"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "257b6f3fe407ae85d454c5348bf65821c77d5cae", "parents": ["42d495bb5940d7c18b6b4b09484b8493ee223cf7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Hubert Boma Manilla \u003chmanilla@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1739382 - [devtools] Display a console warning instead of throwing error (causing a debugger crash). r=nchevobbe, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D132917", "files": ["devtools/client/debugger/src/reducers/sources.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "cd8737e02306f8e788f85a639d43a083c4e6e802", "parents": ["257b6f3fe407ae85d454c5348bf65821c77d5cae"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Yaron Tausky \u003cytausky@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1650214 - Cancel progress timer when shutting down FileReader. r=asuth, a=RyanVM\n\nNot canceling the timer when run in a worker could lead to the timer\nfiring after the primary worker runnable finished running, leading to an\nassertion failure in cycle collector code.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D130252", "files": ["dom/file/FileReader.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "b8c14cd105052a4a95d7db5bb8a1b8ee27273a60", "parents": ["cd8737e02306f8e788f85a639d43a083c4e6e802"], "tags": []}], "date": 1639081317, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "120": {"changesets": [{"author": "Kershaw Chang \u003ckershaw@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1740274 - Avoid accessing Http2Session through raw pointer, r=dragana, a=tjr\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D132684", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/Http2Push.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/Http2Stream.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/Http2Stream.h", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpConnectionMgr.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "6c16d3c9fd420a3a10e9222b20d0c0b8f88ced6f", "parents": ["b8c14cd105052a4a95d7db5bb8a1b8ee27273a60"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nika Layzell \u003cnika@thelayzells.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1740797 - Use an owning string when serializing nsStringInputStream as a pipe, r=smaug, a=tjr\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D131443", "files": ["xpcom/io/nsStringStream.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "0fdb433668d85d55fd8616a35da6744932d43816", "parents": ["6c16d3c9fd420a3a10e9222b20d0c0b8f88ced6f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1742334 - Make sure to null out ChannelEventQueue::mOwner when object is released. r=dragana, a=tjr\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D131896", "files": ["netwerk/ipc/ChannelEventQueue.cpp", "netwerk/ipc/ChannelEventQueue.h", "netwerk/protocol/http/HttpChannelChild.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/HttpChannelParent.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/HttpTransactionParent.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/websocket/WebSocketChannelChild.cpp", "toolkit/components/extensions/webrequest/StreamFilterParent.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "0592ba15e779a54d0c40c2cf72c25f2875a77dcd", "parents": ["0fdb433668d85d55fd8616a35da6744932d43816"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1742382 - Clamp bounds to sampler. r=jrmuizel, a=tjr\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D132720", "files": ["gfx/wr/swgl/src/swgl_ext.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "533804d612ddc3d87b06d4265f5dc4794fe4d568", "parents": ["0592ba15e779a54d0c40c2cf72c25f2875a77dcd"], "tags": []}, {"author": "David Parks \u003cdaparks@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1735071: Make Windows non-ePopupLevelTop popups respect owner z-order. r=edgar, a=tjr\n\nPopups that aren't ePopupLevelTop should only appear above their owner and should do so without changing their owner's Z-order relative to other windows.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D131961", "files": ["widget/windows/nsWindow.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "e99a3304b8f465ca4998a25c175d3a4dab6792b9", "parents": ["533804d612ddc3d87b06d4265f5dc4794fe4d568"], "tags": []}, {"author": "sotaro \u003csotaro.ikeda.g@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1743221 - Clear CompositableParentManager::mCompositables in WebRenderBridgeParent::Destroy(). r=nical, a=tjr\n\nClear mCompositables in WebRenderBridgeParent::Destroy() like ImageBridgeParent::ActorDestroy().\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D132760", "files": ["gfx/layers/wr/WebRenderBridgeParent.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1ee1f800e698720f9714b262368fcea0d2871f9a", "parents": ["e99a3304b8f465ca4998a25c175d3a4dab6792b9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Edgar Chen \u003cechen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1740389; r=handyman, a=tjr\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D131906", "files": ["widget/windows/nsWindow.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "e5b99d030b207c163d43a96aeb232b3f2992634b", "parents": ["1ee1f800e698720f9714b262368fcea0d2871f9a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jari Jalkanen \u003cjjalkanen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1741201 - Increase intermediate byte storage maximum capacity. r=janv, a=tjr\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D131235", "files": ["dom/indexedDB/ActorsParent.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a582903d08214edb92209a63768ed783245e3546", "parents": ["e5b99d030b207c163d43a96aeb232b3f2992634b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1639164281, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "121": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr91 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings - a=repo-update r=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D133623", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/main/search-config.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "7aa78529324bd2b3b234710e28a7ebfad39e2ff3", "parents": ["a582903d08214edb92209a63768ed783245e3546"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003cryanvm@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1277320 - Run GTests on Windows shippable builds as Tier 1. r=glandium, a=test-only\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D133450", "files": ["moz.configure", "taskcluster/ci/test/compiled.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2eef0feffdacb744d46847888a4ffc82ddd566d6", "parents": ["7aa78529324bd2b3b234710e28a7ebfad39e2ff3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Zibi Braniecki \u003czbraniecki@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1687118 - Bail early from DocumentL10n::TriggerInitialTranslation if mReady is not available. r=emilio,nordzilla a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D131253", "files": ["dom/l10n/DocumentL10n.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "e653c1a653632c832d129315f306ef6bc32f1c46", "parents": ["2eef0feffdacb744d46847888a4ffc82ddd566d6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Hubert Boma Manilla \u003chmanilla@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1737252 - [devtools] Escaping back tick signs. r=nchevobbe, a=RyanVM\n\nThis patch escapes the back ticks properly. There may need to be further\nthoughts on having seperate context menu items for powershell versus cmd.exe\nenabling us to efficiently handles those differently.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D131033", "files": ["devtools/client/netmonitor/test/browser_net_curl-utils.js", "devtools/client/shared/curl.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "b5857a3da213cb5401c61de40e60564b68d66b09", "parents": ["e653c1a653632c832d129315f306ef6bc32f1c46"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jonathan Watt \u003cjwatt@jwatt.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1740421. Fix print-to-PDF on Mac OS X 10.12 (e.g. printing with no printers installed). r=jfkthame, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D132372", "files": ["widget/cocoa/nsPrintSettingsX.mm"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "4acdb2e85a222a24510c6fc0cad969471497b259", "parents": ["b5857a3da213cb5401c61de40e60564b68d66b09"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gijs Kruitbosch \u003cgijskruitbosch@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1705211, r=nika,ckerschb a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D131856", "files": ["docshell/base/nsDocShell.cpp", "dom/ipc/ContentParent.cpp", "dom/ipc/ContentParent.h", "dom/ipc/PContent.ipdl", "uriloader/exthandler/nsExternalHelperAppService.cpp", "uriloader/exthandler/nsExternalHelperAppService.h", "uriloader/exthandler/nsExternalProtocolHandler.cpp", "uriloader/exthandler/nsIExternalProtocolService.idl"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "c8fa4ab303fa2deacf90258bafe40b691015b4ed", "parents": ["4acdb2e85a222a24510c6fc0cad969471497b259"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gijs Kruitbosch \u003cgijskruitbosch@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1701394 - fix tab t