o bug - Tagging a1fd35b0b8f66b8660de9ed95223120765de2e11 with FIREFOX_91_4_1esr_BUILD1 a=release CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "06cd4e02acad84ebcb02cd876246cdd7aa7dfc80", "parents": ["26667b202e451c7641ccb99f9d01d364352daf2f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1639605821, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "125": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug - Tagging a1fd35b0b8f66b8660de9ed95223120765de2e11 with FIREFOX_91_4_1esr_RELEASE a=release CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "16aa2cbb357852eedc362c4c40eb40b3c6e2e7fe", "parents": ["06cd4e02acad84ebcb02cd876246cdd7aa7dfc80"], "tags": []}], "date": 1639665467, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "126": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr91 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings tld-suffixes - a=repo-update r=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D133999", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "49ab1a951ed074d3dc93c5df7f62fa15e5e3da4e", "parents": ["16aa2cbb357852eedc362c4c40eb40b3c6e2e7fe"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emily McDonough \u003cemcdonough@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1717703 Part 1 - Set display list clipping rect for nsPageFrame children to use the content size. r=emilio,mattwoodrow a=RyanVM\n\nWithout explicitly setting the clipping rect to the specified page size, the\nbuilding rect of the display lists will be kept to the size of the nsPageFrame.\nThis means that any content in the nsPageContentFrame which is larger than the\nphysical paper size will be clipped.\n\nThe actual content frames are scaled down when this is too large, so no\noverdraw will occur.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D119459", "files": ["layout/generic/nsPageFrame.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "3ef4e62bce04dd9658af603e86b449629c6f8939", "parents": ["49ab1a951ed074d3dc93c5df7f62fa15e5e3da4e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emily McDonough \u003cemcdonough@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1717703 Part 2 - Add test for printing with down-scaled page-size. r=dholbert, a=RyanVM\n\nThis test couldn't succeed without the fix for the clipping issue.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D119460", "files": ["layout/base/tests/chrome/chrome.ini", "layout/base/tests/chrome/print_page_size4.html", "layout/base/tests/chrome/print_page_size4_ref.html", "layout/base/tests/chrome/printpreview_helper.xhtml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "e12584ed608c78ee9c6588e3af63eabf27378919", "parents": ["3ef4e62bce04dd9658af603e86b449629c6f8939"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emily McDonough \u003cemcdonough@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1722890 Part 1 - Apply page scaling to the clipping rect for page content frames. r=dholbert, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D122291", "files": ["layout/generic/nsPageFrame.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "35d63d0da6aa88e4c0e3700c525f486b5ade4293", "parents": ["e12584ed608c78ee9c6588e3af63eabf27378919"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emily McDonough \u003cemcdonough@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1722890 Part 2 - Add disabled print preview test for scaled content on the edge of the clipping rect. r=dholbert, a=RyanVM\n\nScaling currently doesn't work in print preview tests. This adds a test that\nwill begin to fail if scaling gets fixed, to tell us to enable the actual\nscaled content test instead.\n\nSee bug 1725486 for the scaling issue.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D122292", "files": ["layout/base/tests/chrome/bug1722890.html", "layout/base/tests/chrome/bug1722890_ref.html", "layout/base/tests/chrome/chrome.ini", "layout/base/tests/chrome/printpreview_helper.xhtml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "36d4ec7ecfeca12b791fc11ca8675bc8a12dd4e6", "parents": ["35d63d0da6aa88e4c0e3700c525f486b5ade4293"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emily McDonough \u003cemcdonough@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1732836 - Do not apply page scale twice when building display lists for paged content. r=mattwoodrow, a=RyanVM\n\nThis reverts the patch for bug 1720621.\n\nThis caused a conflict with the fix for bug 1722890, which fixed another case\nof cutoff content when printing scaled. That fix should also cover the upscaled\ncase.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D127594", "files": ["layout/generic/nsPageContentFrame.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d50d48964500d71e5769d9bfd80cc535770518a8", "parents": ["36d4ec7ecfeca12b791fc11ca8675bc8a12dd4e6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Matthew Finkel \u003csysrqb@torproject.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1732360 - Add headers needed by MOZ_BUNDLED_FONTS. r=jfkthame, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D126817", "files": ["gfx/thebes/gfxPlatformMac.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "9c2fda826fb631c74015ca6417f7051fbcb657b5", "parents": ["d50d48964500d71e5769d9bfd80cc535770518a8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "lyavor \u003clyavor@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1731971 - https-first causes slow http: sites on non-standard ports to time-out too fast. r=ckerschb, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D127940", "files": ["dom/security/nsHTTPSOnlyUtils.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "7973a2536abbae4e8e104f5818036a9d4eb56cf7", "parents": ["9c2fda826fb631c74015ca6417f7051fbcb657b5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jonathan Kew \u003cjkew@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1745715 - Process app-bundled fonts before system fonts when initializing the font list, to ensure their families get the expected Base visibility level. r=emilio, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D133667", "files": ["gfx/thebes/gfxFcPlatformFontList.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "98cc74958808799a5d2f3be7adea4da42852b791", "parents": ["7973a2536abbae4e8e104f5818036a9d4eb56cf7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Paul Zuehlcke \u003cpbz@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1744158, r=Gijs, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D133392", "files": ["toolkit/mozapps/handling/ContentDispatchChooser.jsm"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "e3675b34e4a540a7e48535bfe8fd6149c1ff95ed", "parents": ["98cc74958808799a5d2f3be7adea4da42852b791"], "tags": []}], "date": 1639671608, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "127": {"changesets": [{"author": "Michelle Goossens \u003cmichelle@masterwayz.nl\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1740943 - Migrate wrench from Windows 10 on AWS to Azure. r=jmaher, a=test-only\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D132848", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/config.yml", "taskcluster/ci/webrender/kind.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "40c97ed4a5905c6585c41affbe9438cbfe9c711d", "parents": ["e3675b34e4a540a7e48535bfe8fd6149c1ff95ed"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michelle Goossens \u003cmichelle@masterwayz.nl\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1746473 - Make wrench jobs run on all branches r=jrmuizel a=test-only\n